. Lower base ATK than Fading Twilight; aimed shots are situational."}],"a":[{"names":["Emblem of Severed Fate"],"text":"ER plus amplified Burst damage.","stats":"ER/ATK% · Electro · CRIT"},{"names":["Noblesse Oblige"],"text":"Burst grants allies 20% ATK.","stats":"ER/ATK% · Electro · CRIT"},{"names":["Noblesse Oblige","Thundering Fury"],"text":"Burst damage and Electro DMG.","stats":"ER/ATK% · Electro · CRIT"}],"t":[{"name":"Shogun Thunder Court","members":["Kujou Sara","Raiden Shogun","Kaedehara Kazuha","Bennett"],"text":"Sara buffs Raiden before her Burst; Kazuha shreds Electro RES and Bennett adds healing and ATK. C6 Sara greatly amplifies Electro CRIT hits.","roles":["Buffer","Main DPS","Support","Healer / Buffer"]},{"name":"Aggravate Edict","members":["Kujou Sara","Keqing","Fischl","Yaoyao"],"text":"Yaoyao enables Quicken; Fischl supplies off-field Electro and energy. Sara buffs Keqing’s short damage window, especially at C6.","roles":["ATK Buffer","On-field DPS","Off-field DPS / Battery","Healer / Dendro Enabler"]},{"name":"Clorinde Lightning","members":["Kujou Sara","Clorinde","Fischl","Kirara"],"text":"Kirara enables Quicken and protection; Fischl batteries the team. Sara buffs Clorinde’s Electro damage, but her short buff limits uptime.","roles":["ATK Buffer","On-field DPS","Off-field DPS / Battery","Shielder / Dendro Enabler"]},{"name":"Overload Commission","members":["Kujou Sara","Raiden Shogun","Chevreuse","Xiangling"],"text":"Only Electro/Pyro teammates preserve Chevreuse’s Overloaded support. Sara buffs Raiden, while Xiangling provides Pyro and off-field damage.","roles":["ATK Buffer","On-field DPS / Battery","Healer / Buffer","Off-field DPS / Pyro Enabler"]}],"v":"C6 Electro Buffer: C6 grants 60% Electro CRIT DMG to buffed allies; refresh Sara’s short ATK buff immediately before the carry attacks.\nBurst DPS: Use Emblem, Electro DMG and CRIT. Skyward Harp, Polar Star or Mouun’s Moon raise personal Burst damage.\nNoblesse Buffer: Use 4pc Noblesse when no teammate already carries it; prioritize ER to Burst regularly.\nFavonius Battery: Trade some ATK-buff strength for team particles. Build enough CRIT Rate and trigger the passive on field.\nBudget Buff: Fading Twilight works if owned; otherwise use craftable Prototype Crescent or another high-base-ATK bow.","n":3},"seo":{"roles":["Support / Sub DPS"],"about":"Kujou Sara is an Electro quickswap buffer whose short Crowfeather ATK boost scales with her base ATK and Skill level. Her Burst adds strong damage, while C6 grants buffed allies 60% Electro CRIT DMG. She shines with fast, Electro-focused carries.","pros":["Strong base-ATK buff","C6 Electro CRIT boost","High Burst damage","Excellent with Raiden"],"cons":["Very short buff window","High Energy needs","Awkward setup before C2","Needs an Electro carry"],"weapons":["Elegy for the End","Skyward Harp","Polar Star","Mouun's Moon","Fading Twilight","Sacrificial Bow","Favonius Warbow","Prototype Crescent"],"arts":[{"sets":["Emblem of Severed Fate"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Best"},{"sets":["Noblesse Oblige"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Team"},{"sets":["Noblesse Oblige","Thundering Fury"],"pcs":"2 + 2 pcs","role":"Interim"}],"main":["Energy Recharge / ATK%","Electro DMG Bonus","CRIT Rate / CRIT DMG"],"stats":["Raiden ER: 170%+","2 Electro: 230%+","3 Electro: 130-160%","CRIT Rate: 60-70%","CRIT DMG: 120%+"],"vars":[{"title":"C6 Electro Hypercarry Buffer","role":"Support","weapons":["Elegy for the End","Skyward Harp","Fading Twilight"],"arts":[{"sets":["Noblesse Oblige"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Emblem of Severed Fate"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"Meet ER needs first; high weapon base ATK determines her ATK buff.","teams":"Electro damage dealer with a brief, frontloaded attack window.","when":"Apply Sara’s Crowfeather or Burst buff just before Raiden/Keqing attacks. C6 adds 60% Electro CRIT DMG that cannot be snapshotted.","cond":"Requires C6 for CRIT DMG bonus.","notes":"Skill talent increases the base-ATK-scaling ATK buff; artifact A